421 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 286 0 R
/E (Many bedtime fears start with something a child saw. Even videos and games that look made for kids can include scary scenes. Choose calm, familiar shows during the day, and turn screens off well before bedtime.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
