424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 286 0 R
/E (The spray isn't magic, and it doesn't keep monsters away. It's a playful reminder of Psalm 91:11: 'For he shall give his angels charge over thee, to keep thee in all thy ways.' A few sprays at bedtime become your child's way of saying, 'God is watching over me.')
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
